    "matched_retrain": "FRESH base + fresh LoRA; transformed full mapping; route h's own protocol (3000/200/2e-05, uniform repeat 50, seed 17) PLUS the EDIT recipe's target oversampling (target_boost=5); reported as matched_retrain_weighted.  The x5 is mx.TARGET_BOOST from the suppression recipe, NOT route h's recipe: rd.train_h builds every mapping at a uniform repeat with no target boost",
